WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.070
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.190
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.880
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:10.640
Toriko and the others 
engaged Joie in a fight.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:14.370
But they were helpless against 
Joie's overwhelming strength.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.820
Meanwhile, Ichiryu clashed with 
Midora in the Gourmet World,

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.820
and it was a hard battle indeed.

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:22.980
And the Four Kings

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:26.690
put their powers together in order 
to take a stand against Joie

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.290
and performed an ultimate combination skill!

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:38.130
Be Heard, Komatsu's Scream! Toriko Revives!

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:58.440
W-Wow...

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.630
It's even devouring space?

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.440
This is the power of the Four Kings!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.460
An overwhelming appetite that exceeds

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.480
the one from the battle with the Four-Beasts.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:21.920
I'm gonna take ya down an' then eat...

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.450
...Acacia's Full Course!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.180
ATOM!

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:27.700
EARTH!

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.640
I'm gonna eat GOD!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.140
We're gonna eat it together!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.550
Eat it together, you say?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.080
How naive!

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.680
Space Slicer!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.540
Was that your ace in the hole?

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.270
Your Main Dish skill?

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.230
You put too much stock in it,

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.660
Four Kings Gourmet Hunters.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:41.630
It can't be...

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.230
The Four Kings are...

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:54.540
Everything in this space is my prey!

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:07.520
It seems you're a slave to your appetite,

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:08.900
Midora.

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.510
It's our duty

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:16.650
to carry on Acacia-sama's 
will and Froese-sama's heart.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.460
But...

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.270
...you've lost to your own appetite.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.250
No matter what it takes,

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.190
I have to stop you.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.580
That's my...

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:35.310
...final and greatest mission!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.430
That recovery speed...

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.190
It looks like you've thoroughly 
mastered Food's End.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.600
Secret Art!

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.640
Perfect Chopsticks for a King's Meal!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.820
At the end...

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.160
At the end, I wanted to let you hit me.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.370
Old age is truly

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.960
a sad thing.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:31.340
Ichiryu, I envied you once.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.770
Is this the best you can do?

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:37.000
This is all you've got?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:02.140
And now, I'll finish this.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.910
His Gourmet Cells...

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.420
...are outside his body...

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.940
This has taken a little 
more time than I wished.

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:47.080
So, as I was saying, you're 
going to accompany me.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.980
No power...

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.550
Can barely speak...

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.590
M-Matsu!

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.000
P-Please...

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.780
You're sure?

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:49.700
W-What is this?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:04.090
T-Toriko's Gourmet Cells...

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.060
...took on material form!

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:09.930
During our battle,

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:14.200
his Gourmet Cells also bloomed?

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.470
Gourmet Cells!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.880
It's wild nature.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.860
Pure appetite...

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:25.610
It'll devour whatever instinct indicates.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.090
A true demon!

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:36.220
He won't be able to hold it back!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:40.220
If he lets his Gourmet 
Cells take over any longer,

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.710
they won't hesitate

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.860
to devour everything!

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.670
Come and get me.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.640
Give free rein to your instincts.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.920
Stop it! Don't rile him up!

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.220
This isn't a joke!

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.520
I'm well aware of that.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:13.940
If his Gourmet Cells go berserk, 
I will also be in danger.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:17.200
But that's part of the fun.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.060
What?!

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:22.040
Gourmet Hunter Toriko's instincts...

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:26.070
...will cause him to murder his comrades!

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:28.240
No...

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.170
Everyone's going to eat 
Acacia's Full Course together.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:35.260
That's what you people said,

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.560
but it seems you still don't comprehend.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.440
Didn't I already tell you?

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:45.280
It's not just about the taste.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.790
Acacia's Full Course,

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:51.250
GOD is, more sublime than that.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:52.920
What do you mean?

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:57.900
It's the key to making this world mine.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:01.670
Eating it when you don't 
even understand its value is

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.370
the height of stupidity!

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.730
What's that?!

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:09.980
Compared to you fools, he's preferable.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.250
He's got a saving grace.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:16.350
You see, he's going to try 
to consume everything.

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:19.160
If there's something you want

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.780
or need, you should monopolize it.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.760
If you want to eat something,

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.390
you should eat it alone.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.410
Eat together, you say?

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.950
How does it profit you to share?

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:34.320
Does that hold some meaning?

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.220
Observe.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.040
This is a person's nature.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.060
Their true nature!

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.200
You can't hold back

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.760
your savage need!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.020
Now! Follow your instincts

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.230
and gobble up everything!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:02.770
Stop!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.170
It's too late to stop him.

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:07.340
Toriko!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.160
Your Gourmet Cells have emerged...

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:27.930
...Midora?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.590
You're starving, aren't you?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.330
Love...

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:01.290
The love of a family...

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.920
Even now, you're just searching for that.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:13.840
Isn't that right, Midora?

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:18.310
The roar of a demon will 
become a meteor shower

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:21.850
that rains down on the Human World.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.380
But before that,

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:28.150
I'll finish you off with my own hands.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:32.310
You really have gotten strong.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.620
I wanted all of us

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.650
to sit at the table

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.070
one last time together.

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.930
Sit at the dining table together...

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:50.320
Just like the old days...

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.700
Farewell...

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.490
...Big Brother!

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:17.460
Midora...

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:27.980
Even when it's hard because 
someone's hurt you...

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:31.210
Even when you're hungry or sad...

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:36.420
...we'll always be with you.

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.600
All of us...

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.760
We're your family

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.430
and we're here for you.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:53.960
Never forget that.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.140
Now, feed...

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.750
...Toriko!

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.490
C-Crap!

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:52.130
There's nothing we can do to stop him?!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:58.300
Cocky bastard!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:12.820
Komatsu-kun!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.690
Please stop it!

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:19.730
Remember what you said?

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:22.320
That we'd all eat GOD together!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.470
You promised, remember?!

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:30.290
That we'd team up

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.740
and make the ultimate Full Course together!

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:37.240
Please come back to us!

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:47.090
Toriko-san!!!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:01.520
What is this...?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.250
Food...

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.930
...ain't energy alone.

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:09.660
It's an important thing for humans.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:12.610
Komatsu is always givin' me that.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:14.880
Toriko-san!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:17.350
As long as I have that,

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:20.620
I'll get up again and again.

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:23.920
Oh... Your partner...

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:25.320
Interesting.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:30.580
In that case, even that man's Full Course...

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.860
Someday...

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.000
Leave it to me.

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:48.550
What?!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.950
After all, I made a promise...

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:15.010
...Komatsu.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:20.510
To make the ultimate Full Course together...

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:22.880
Toriko-san!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.010
We're gonna eat

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:28.300
Acacia's Full Course!

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.190
We're gonna eat GOD!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.410
We're all gonna sit around a table together.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:01.750
That's...

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.960
...what I decided.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.830
Sit around a table together...

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:12.940
You restrained Gourmet Cells gone berserk...

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:16.810
Overflowing wild instincts...

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:21.010
Humans have the desire just to eat,

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:23.370
but you can't live by instincts alone.

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.800
There's also respect for food...

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:29.360
Appreciation, sharing...

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.350
'Cause humans got heart!

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:36.110
Heart?

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.960
I'll give that a...

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.760
...Fatal Chop!

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:58.740
This is the power of Gourmet Cells!

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:02.420
I see...

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:05.770
It seems you're different from before.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.920
But then how about this?

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:11.050
Secret Art: Satanic Chunk!

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:14.290
What?!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.730
This power...

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:19.200
...was created by all my travels up to now.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.430
Coco...

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:23.000
Sunny...

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.500
Zebra... My travels with them...

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.130
And battles where my life was on the line...

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:32.020
...fostered my power.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.680
And this body

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:41.250
is made up of all the lives

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.520
of the ingredients I've captured up to now.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:49.210
That and the appreciation I have for Komatsu,

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:52.810
who cooked the ingredients, made 
them delicious, and imbued them with

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:54.370
the warmth of the human heart!

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.360
Toriko-san!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.200
What nonsense...?

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:05.760
Ingredients are only tools to control...

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:12.420
...the world!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:20.790
I <i>will</i> get what I desire!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:24.430
I won't let anyone interfere!

00:21:30.550 --> 00:21:31.930
Come on, then.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:34.060
I'll show you...

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:35.990
...everything.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:40.640
All of...

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.990
...the power of life!

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:57.180
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:02.740
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:22:02.740 --> 00:22:08.440
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:13.600
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:19.340
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:22:19.340 --> 00:22:25.140
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:31.200
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:36.580
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:37.740
Mega Raba

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:40.960
Mega Raba

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:43.600
Mega Raba
